{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01796",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 6.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Mm, um, hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.85,
      "end_seconds": 13.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Okay, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.74,
      "end_seconds": 20.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Well, I've been having tingling in my thumb and first fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.57,
      "end_seconds": 29.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.91,
      "end_seconds": 45.44,
      "duration_seconds": 15.53,
      "text": "So, I've had it since last Tuesday. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.25,
      "end_seconds": 57.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.01,
      "end_seconds": 63.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say. It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.25,
      "end_seconds": 69.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Have you been waking at night with numb hands?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.17,
      "end_seconds": 75.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Mm, uh, yeah. About two weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.4,
      "end_seconds": 83.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Alright, tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.79,
      "end_seconds": 88.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.62,
      "end_seconds": 91.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.57,
      "end_seconds": 94.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.23,
      "end_seconds": 100.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.92,
      "end_seconds": 113.07,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. No, I share a house with my brother. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.24,
      "end_seconds": 118.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.56,
      "end_seconds": 142.8,
      "duration_seconds": 19.24,
      "text": "Paracetamol. I take it 650 milligrams, when needed. Actually, though honestly, some days I forget to take it. Sorry, what was I saying, I'm on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.23,
      "end_seconds": 148.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.47,
      "end_seconds": 152.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.12,
      "end_seconds": 157.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.58,
      "end_seconds": 161.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.6,
      "end_seconds": 166.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.11,
      "end_seconds": 170.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.94,
      "end_seconds": 174.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.9,
      "end_seconds": 180.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Yes, um, I had a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.66,
      "end_seconds": 194.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weakness in the legs or neck pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.69,
      "end_seconds": 198.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.4,
      "end_seconds": 206.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Alright, any pain in the shoulder?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.97,
      "end_seconds": 211.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "No, no pain in the shoulder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.01,
      "end_seconds": 215.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.22,
      "end_seconds": 217.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.76,
      "end_seconds": 221.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.22,
      "end_seconds": 225.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.43,
      "end_seconds": 237.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.37,
      "end_seconds": 248.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.93,
      "end_seconds": 270.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.8 degrees, pulse is 86 beats a minute, pressure 110 over 74, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.95,
      "end_seconds": 277.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.32,
      "end_seconds": 279.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.53,
      "end_seconds": 295.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Tapping over the wrist brings on the tingling and the thumb muscle is slightly thin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.43,
      "end_seconds": 312.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.51,
      "end_seconds": 323.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with carpal tunnel syndrome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.8,
      "end_seconds": 328.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I'm, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.58,
      "end_seconds": 360.84,
      "duration_seconds": 31.26,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's carpal tunnel syndrome, and we'll know more once the a nerve conduction study is back. I'll request a nerve conduction study, it'll help with carpal tunnel. Wear a wrist splint at night. I'm going to send a referral to the hand clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.06,
      "end_seconds": 363.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.04,
      "end_seconds": 372.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "I'd like you back in six weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.43,
      "end_seconds": 377.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.04,
      "end_seconds": 380.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}